  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5102.04 Beaver Lake",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.04 Beaver Lake.\n\n(a) Notwithstanding any other rule to the contrary, no person shall operate a boat at a speed exceeding 10 miles per hour on Beaver Lake in the town of Derry. This restriction shall not apply between the hours of 1:00 p.m. and 7:00 p.m. daily, and further provided that during unrestricted hours no boat shall exceed 30 miles per hour at any time.\n\n(b) All water skiing on Beaver Lake shall be in a counter-clockwise direction at all times.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100) #9953, EXEMPT, eff 7-1-11; renumbered by #10169 (formerly Saf-C 5102.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5100.html"
